Okay then...

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.100
What?!

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.680
I swear I pressed down!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.380
My chest is getting squashed!

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.050
Yours are all muscle anyway, so don't worry.

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:45.420
Like hell they are!

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:50.220
This is going to ruin my beautiful figure!

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.860
We have confirmed the two are
heading up on the linear elevator.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:58.730
Do not trust any info from Brian!
Use your best judgment!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.970
Jeez, how far up is it going to go?!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.240
As if the elevator is going
to give you an answer!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.810
You know, sometimes you really piss me off!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.280
Should we end our partnership, then?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.610
Best idea I've heard all day!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:17.320
You two!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.290
You're the 3WA Trouble Consultants, right?

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.420
That's right! We're the Lovely Angels!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:24.390
I can barely hear them.
Hey, adjust the microphone.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.290
Are you the 3WA Trouble Consultants?

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:28.320
We're the Lovely Angels!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.130
Hey, it's the Dirty Pair!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.500
Oh, crap. It's really them, the Dirty Pair!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.040
We can hear you!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.370
E-Excuse us.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.640
We have an urgent request.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.940
We'd like to request your assistance
in stopping Brian's malfunction.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.650
All right. Will you take us to the computer room?

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:52.850
Brian has sealed off the computer room,
but we can take you somewhere nearby...

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.730
Looks like there's no getting down from here.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.480
Kei, call the Lovely Angel.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.070
But to contact our ship, we need...

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:21.950
Mughi!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:22.880
That's right!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.220
Mughi!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:32.150
Listen closely to what I'm about to say.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.930
You're going to ride in the capsule by yourself!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:37.630
Then you're going to bring our
ship here, along with Nanmo!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:41.240
The communicator in our room is broken,
so we can't contact anybody from here.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.860
You can do all that by yourself, right?
Do you understand?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.770
Here, hold on tight.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.250
Mister, you have to save the big kitty, too.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:51.650
Huh? R-Right...
Mister, you have to save the big kitty, too.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.910
Huh? R-Right...

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.780
Okay Mughi, get moving!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.880
Kitty, don't go!

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.420
Do you think it'll work?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.580
Have faith in our dear pet.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.410
Yuri! Behind you!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:36.420
Got 'em!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.950
But now we're even worse off!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.540
Mughi, we're counting on you.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.350
Ah, this is so pathetic.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:01.250
I can't believe I'm going to fall
to my death while holding on to you!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.480
Then let go!

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.420
Surely you jest...

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:07.920
Hey, stop that!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.620
This is really bad!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.600
I saw this in a movie once!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.970
What happens to the heroine?!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.370
S-She finds a way out of it, of course!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.300
Of course she does.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.470
It's hopeless! We're done for!

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:31.170
We're falling!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.490
N-Nicely done.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.420
Should I let you go?

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.790
S-Surely you jest.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.260
Th-The parachute is too small!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.630
It's better than nothing!

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.730
Look! Over there! It's a bunch of air cars!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.510
You still can't get it to move?

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:08.240
Shut up! This is delicate
work, so stop grumbling!

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.980
Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.410
I said, stop grumbling.
Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:12.810
Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:13.780
It's working!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.340
Hang on!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:32.800
Here they come!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.570
Our guests are here, too!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.040
Why you!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:02.860
Wait, isn't this the exhaust duct
for the incinerator dome?

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:03.460
Sure is.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:03.900
What?!
Sure is.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:04.430
What?!

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.630
If we keep going, we'll be burned to ash!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.910
This furnace system sparks every
five seconds. Didn't you know that?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.870
We'll be fine if we turn back before then.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.040
And just who controls the furnace system?

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.410
Ahh! Brian does!

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.540
I knew you weren't thinking!

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.380
Well, this is no good.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.200
They're gone.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:44.140
This is all because you
never think things through.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.440
Oh, be quiet!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.780
Quit complaining and get moving!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.440
Come on, come on! Move it, move it!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.240
Stop pushing!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.850
Who do you think just saved us?

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:56.540
None of this would have
happened if it weren't for you!

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.610
Nanmo, connect us to Brian.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:35.590
What is it? You are not human, I see.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.890
In fact, you are closer in kind to me.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.630
What's the reason for all this ruckus, Brian?

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.030
You are the reason.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.670
Mankind has betrayed me.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.670
You're the one who did the betraying!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.260
I manage every system in this tower.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:56.040
Yet, I discovered a unit that I did not recognize.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:56.380
The Z-box!
Yet, I discovered a unit that I did not recognize.

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:57.680
The Z-box!

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:03.350
I also discovered that if that unit is activated,
I will lose the majority of my memory.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:06.350
Then, we'll have it removed! So stop this!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:09.990
I have already overridden the
unit in question. I will not stop.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:13.560
Brian is the type of computer that requires
extremely low temperatures to operate, right?

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:14.400
Yup.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.060
Nanmo, activate the thermo sensor!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.870
Target the coldest spot.

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.890
Set the main laser countdown to fifteen.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:22.800
Are you serious?

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:23.300
Yes!
Are you serious?

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:23.740
Yes!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.440
Hey, Brian. You heard that, right?

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.580
If you don't want to be scrapped,
you should start behaving now!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.380
Our laser is much more powerful
than anything you have.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.570
Negative!

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.350
Fine, you bratty computer!

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.820
Nanmo, activate it!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.450
It used something to reflect the laser!

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.700
Brian, are you listening?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:32.440
Yes, and that will certainly be
another black mark for the Dirty Pair.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.960
Mind your own business!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.980
Since you're so smart,
there's something I want to ask you.

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.850
You obviously have data
on the two of us, right?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:44.910
Yes.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.380
Then, who's the better woman? Me or Yuri?

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:51.450
If you can answer that,
we won't bother you anymore.

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:52.960
This is meaningless.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:58.390
You can't come up with an answer, huh?
Idiot! Clunker! Worthless pile of circuits!

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.230
I will do it, then.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.210
I did it!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:08.580
Did what?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.140
I created a distraction. Now's our chance!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.040
Then!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.080
Nanmo, cut off all communication with Brian.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.280
Get us connected with the Warp Terminal.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.310
What are they up to?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.610
Huh? What did you want us to warp?

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.980
There's too much interference!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.450
Trash, gas, dust, anything!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.920
We'll give you the warp coordinates!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:56.890
Ah, actually we do have a junk ship
that we've been trying to offload.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.630
But we've never done something like this before.
The whole thing could blow apart.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.100
It doesn't matter! Just hurry!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.530
Wait a minute!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:04.460
It's fine!

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.580
They truly are the notorious Dirty Pair!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:21.010
Part of the incident that destroyed
Planet Lameere, with 3521 wounded...

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:27.660
Listen, Kei! Computers break when even
little things like dust get inside them, right?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:30.390
What will happen if you warp
an entire spaceship in there?!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.090
I know, but we still have to do it!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.260
This is the Warp Terminal.
We've received the warp coordinates.

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:40.760
Huh?! A-Are you sure this is the correct target?

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.570
What's your name and Check Number?!

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:47.340
Keep questioning me, and I'll
put you on the 3WA's Black List!

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:48.930
Prepare for warp immediately!

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.950
What?

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.680
What are you scheming?

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.650
I can't believe you.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:00.080
I won't forgive humanity.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:03.520
Dirty Pair, restore communication!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.360
Ten seconds to warp!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.330
Nine.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.330
Eight.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.100
Seven.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:12.030
I will not allow you to keep information from me.

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:12.200
Three.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:12.930
Hurry!
Three.

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:13.800
Hurry!
Two.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:14.600
One!

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:15.730
Warp!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.430
What have you two been doing?!

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:41.020
I've been shouting my lungs out all night!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.260
Hey, do you copy?

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.330
Kei!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:45.470
Yuri!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.430
Hey!

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:47.730
Answer me!!

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:50.970
Hey, Kei. It's Chief Gooley.

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.230
I'm going to bed.

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:56.740
W-What is this?!

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:59.580
Looks like we need to build another computer.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.880
What an incredible thing to do!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.650
They're not called the Dirty Pair for nothing!

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:13.230
At any rate, I wonder if Brian
ever came up with an answer?

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:16.290
Of course it did! There's only
one right answer, after all.

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:49.830
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:56.340
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:02.840
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:09.440
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.890
Space Fantasy

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:16.220
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.360
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:22.300
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:28.770
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:35.000
It wouldn't matter to me, because I've fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:39.010
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:41.750
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:48.150
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:05.240
Yeah, yeah. And?

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:07.910
I see, I see!

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:08.280
Yup, yup.
I see, I see!

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:09.040
Yup, yup.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:12.450
I see!

00:24:12.450 --> 00:24:14.680
Come on, Yuri. Translate that for everybody.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.450
Okay, sure.

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:16.380
Next episode is!

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:18.950
"Do Lovely Angels Prefer Chest Hair?"

00:24:18.950 --> 00:24:21.620
Don't go out of your way to watch-mff!

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:22.920
Next Episode
Do Lovely Angels Prefer Chest Hair?

00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:25.960
Next Episode
Do Lovely Angels Prefer Chest Hair?
It's exciting! It's exciting,
so be sure to watch it, okay?

00:24:25.960 --> 00:24:27.550
Next Episode
